 "gaps": [
  {
   "text": "No IR-specific FCTM or PDP module exists; the flow uses the generic ECAM handling (FCTM AOP-30-30, PDP Management of abnormal operations). No callout is given for the ATT HDG switching itself.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
    {
     "book": "FCTM",
     "code": "PR-AEP-NAV",
     "page": "P 1/20",
     "pdf": 478
    },
    {
     "book": "PDP",
     "code": "Management of abnormal operations",
     "page": "XFTDN6ECAM00001",
     "pdf": 424
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The alert is inhibited in flight phases 4, 5, 7 and 8 (and partly 3). The manuals give no separate crew procedure for an IR loss with no ECAM alert; detection then relies on the PFD/ND flags and the overhead FAULT light.",
